#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:140
msgid "GPU-accelerated alignment"
msgstr "Poravnanje ubrzano GPU-om"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:142
msgid ""
"`Image.draw_image` accepts a ``transform=`` argument — a 3x3 homography "
"matrix as a 2-D ulab.numpy array. On the OpenMV N6 the GPU runs the per-"
"pixel projection during the same draw, so the Lepton frame can be re-aligned"
" against the colour camera's perspective without a separate warp pass. "
"Calibrate the matrix per camera with the `thermal-overlay-calibration tool "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv-projects/tree/master/tools/thermal-"
"overlay-calibration>`_::"
msgstr ""
"`Image.draw_image` prihvaća argument ``transform=`` — homografsku matricu "
"3x3 kao 2-D ulab.numpy polje. Na OpenMV N6 GPU izvodi projekciju po pikselu "
"tijekom istog crtanja, tako da se Lepton sličica može ponovno poravnati "
"prema perspektivi kamere u boji bez zasebnog prolaza iskrivljavanja. "
"Kalibrirajte matricu za svaku kameru pomoću `alata thermal-overlay-"
"calibration <https://github.com/openmv/openmv-"
"projects/tree/master/tools/thermal-overlay-calibration>`_\\ ::"

#: ../../openmvcam/sensors/pag7936.rst:196
msgid ""
"Note that this variant runs the colour camera at `csi.VGA` (640x480) and the"
" Lepton at `csi.QQVGA` (160x120) — the homography projects the smaller "
"Lepton frame into the larger colour frame as part of the draw, so the "
"upscale factor is baked into the matrix itself rather than applied "
"separately."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da ova varijanta pokreće kameru u boji na `csi.VGA` (640x480) "
"i Lepton na `csi.QQVGA` (160x120) — homografija projicira manju Lepton "
"sličicu u veću sličicu u boji kao dio crtanja, tako da je faktor povećanja "
"ugrađen u samu matricu umjesto da se primjenjuje zasebno."
